69
00:03:14,300 --> 00:03:17,340
concepts and actually
do the programming?

70
00:03:17,340 --> 00:03:20,760
So what are some topics
we'll be covering?

71
00:03:20,760 --> 00:03:23,480
We will be, at the
core of it, learning

72
00:03:23,480 --> 00:03:24,800
