94
00:04:20,959 --> 00:04:23,300
They're not super
complicated, but they're

95
00:04:23,300 --> 00:04:26,150
kind of the base algorithms
for a bunch of algorithms

96
00:04:26,150 --> 00:04:28,190
you might see in
the future if you

97
00:04:28,190 --> 00:04:30,708
